mounting pattern: 2x4 Inserts
topsheet: Premium Eco Topsheet (durable, scratch resistant, made of bio-plastic from castor beans)
laminate: Triax Fiberglass (three-layer, multi-directional for dynamic and controlled ride with mid-stiff torsional flex)
laminate stringers: BComp Carbon Flax Stringer (carbon for pop, flax for vibration dampening with lower emissions)
laminate dampening: Koroyd (aerospace-inspired, lightest dampening material, absorbs vibrations and lightens tips)
resin: Bio Resin (plant based, more environmentally friendly than petroleum based epoxy)
core: Boost Core (responsibly harvested Bamboo, Paulownia, and Poplar; Bamboo stringers along sidecut for durability, torsional stiffness, and response)
sidewalls: Recycled ABS Sidewalls (round finish, deflects impact to prevent chipping and cracks)
edges: Recycled Edges (recycled German steel, strongest and longest lasting)
base: Sintered 8000 Base (top-tier sintered, fast, good wax retention, easy to repair, durable)
edge technology: Traction Tech (strategically placed contact points for enhanced edge grip)
base contouring: 3D Base Contouring (reduces tip drag for effortless turns, better glide, enhanced float)
factory tuning: Factory Tuned (detuned in tip and tail, ready to ride)
factory wax: WEND Natural Wax
flex technology: Forever Flex (overbuilt then broken in at factory to mimic 20 days ridden)
pro riders: Victor de la Rue, Jimmy Goodman
